@style(../styles/IDocDemo.style)
@title(Templates and reuse)

Macros, conditions and included files.

@section(Macros and conditions)

@subsection(@@def)

Define a reusable macro with parameters; call it as name(args).

@def(warn(text))
@b{Warning:} text
@enddef

@subsection(@@if)

Conditional content — else gives the alternative.

@if(level > 2)
harder version
@else
easier version
@end

@section(Including files)

@subsection(@@inc)

Include a file: another .idoc splices in, an image becomes img, anything else becomes a code listing.

@inc(file=part.idoc)

@code(file=x.cpp, run)
@end

@inc(file=x.cpp#helper)

@subsection(@@include)

Extract a named snip region from a file.

@include("lib.cpp", solve)

@subsection(@@input)

Include a whole .idoc, recursively (spec spelling).

@input("intro.idoc")

@input(shared/ece-policies.course)

@input(logic-bank.idoc)
